{
  "name": "Overdue invoice chaser (polite reminder emails from a sheet)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "daysInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtHour": 9
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "fdadc8ec-0aa3-5282-b93f-fb6722319f28",
      "name": "Schedule",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "raw",
        "jsonOutput": "{\n  \"config\": {\n    \"sheet_url\": \"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/YOUR_SHEET_ID/edit\",\n    \"sheet_tab\": \"Invoices\",\n    \"owner_email\": \"you@example.com\",\n    \"business_name\": \"Your Business\",\n    \"sender_name\": \"Your Name\"\n  }\n}",
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "97b68c7a-4131-5838-9298-694b2a02e481",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "read",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.config.sheet_url }}"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.config.sheet_tab }}"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "20b493f2-a360-5b3e-aac3-afe19c323700",
      "name": "Read rows",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.7,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ],
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const daysSince = (v) => { const t = Date.parse(v); return isNaN(t) ? null : (Date.now() - t) / 86400000; };\nconst daysUntil = (v) => { const t = Date.parse(v); return isNaN(t) ? null : (t - Date.now()) / 86400000; };\nconst has = (v) => v !== undefined && v !== null && String(v).trim() !== '';\nconst cfg = $('Settings').first().json.config;\nreturn $input.all().filter((item) => {\n  const r = item.json;\n  return (String(r.status).toLowerCase() !== 'paid' && daysUntil(r.due_date) !== null && daysUntil(r.due_date) < -3 && (!has(r.last_reminder_at) || daysSince(r.last_reminder_at) > 7));\n}).slice(0, 50);"
      },
      "id": "bff6ddd9-478b-5d34-8de4-2518abe01443",
      "name": "Find rows to act on",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        720,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $json.email }}",
        "subject": "=Reminder: invoice {{ $json.invoice_no }}",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "=Hi {{ $json.client_name }},\n\nA friendly reminder that invoice {{ $json.invoice_no }} for {{ $json.amount }} was due on {{ $json.due_date }}. If you have already paid, thank you and please ignore this.\n\nKind regards,\n{{ $('Settings').first().json.config.sender_name }}\n{{ $('Settings').first().json.config.business_name }}",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "id": "3f9a471c-fb6c-5928-8472-dd9e9b71ff41",
      "name": "Send email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        960,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const stamp = new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10);\nreturn $('Find rows to act on').all().map((item) => ({ json: { row_number: item.json.row_number, \"last_reminder_at\": stamp } }));"
      },
      "id": "3772d57f-d754-543d-8222-275511b10557",
      "name": "Mark rows as done",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1200,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.config.sheet_url }}"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.config.sheet_tab }}"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {},
          "matchingColumns": [
            "row_number"
          ],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {
          "cellFormat": "RAW",
          "handlingExtraData": "ignoreIt"
        }
      },
      "id": "5ed8caef-dfa4-548c-b837-a3cd9914b25b",
      "name": "Update rows",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.7,
      "position": [
        1440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Overdue invoice chaser (polite reminder emails from a sheet)\nEach morning finds unpaid invoices past their due date and emails the client a polite reminder, then marks the row.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "bda56865-a7cd-5705-9da8-eb9d3dd6be7e",
      "name": "Note: what this does",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup (about 10 minutes)\n1. Use a Google Sheet with a tab named **Invoices** and these headers in row 1: see `sheet-headers.csv`.\n2. Open **Settings** and fill in your sheet URL, your email and names.\n3. Connect Google Sheets and Gmail on the nodes with warnings.\n4. Check the rule in **Find rows to act on** (it shows exactly which rows get an email) and the wording in **Send email**.\n5. Run it once by hand with a test row, then switch the workflow to **Active**.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "fcff5a9f-68e3-5a6b-b5d4-86f1e0f576eb",
      "name": "Note: setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        400,
        -400
      ]
    }
  ],
